# Server-Inspection-MCP
服务器巡检 MCP

服务器运行 agent 程序，PC 运行 MCP 程序

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "forensics ssh mcp": {
      "command": "uv",
      "args": [
        "--directory",
        "your_path",
        "run",
        "main.py"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

- [ ] ws 连接
- [ ] rsa 加密
